          "en": "<p>Today, the Colosseum is Italy's most famous landmark and an eternal symbol of classical civilization, welcoming over 7 million visitors every year. Extensive laser cleanings and multi-million-euro preservation projects have restored the original bright color of its travertine stone.</p><p>A revolutionary high-tech wooden retractable arena floor has been introduced, allowing visitors to stand precisely where gladiators once fought while protecting the ancient Hypogeum below, ensuring this architectural giant inspires humanity for millennia to come.</p>",
